  "body": "CHECK MAINLINE-046 complete; QUESTIONABLE/PROJECTION. Independently rebuilt all 389 CSV rows and frequency-5 geometry. Of 3,796 field checks, 3,780 match strictly; all 16 differences resolve to the explicitly rounded seam reference (maximum 6.4851e-9 kg). All 135 displayed calculation cells and fourteen NIST source pairs match. All 115 non-code manifest pins verify; two owner executables excluded without access.\n\nRequired retention 0.794753/0.874673/0.923186, warehouse ten-year SF 1.084071/0.985018/0.933256, and hot/full-restraint SF 1.092731/0.995706/0.944784 reproduce. The 041 OD4/white package is 95.751051 kg. With hot film correction and allocated equipment, closure deficits remain 31.465–51.465 kg / 39.916–59.916 kg.\n\nPrimary sources confirm approximate ageing anchors and SK99/DM20 creep exponents. Outdoor interior residual reaches 0.082089; warehouse reading uncertainty crosses SF1 at both 041 points. The hot 041-5 annual loss ceiling is 0.457%, below the 0.5% requirement. SK99 chemistry-only mass does not establish creep suitability.\n\nOne minor labeling finding: 458.672527 kg/year is coupon water only; adding declared-weather weighted leakage gives 459.261468 kg/year at 041. Eight quantified checker NFI entries, 22 owner entries and inherited registers remain open. Qualified installed life and hull SF remain null. Brief says stop and file; no successor.",
